@startuml F1.10-D01-listar-formativas
title F1.10-D01 — Listar formativas
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "FormativeController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: abre /formativas
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /formativas
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT + filtros
Postgres --> Ctrl: lista
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 + _links
note right of WebApp
  _links.nova só se formative.submit
end note
WebApp --> Aluno: tabela / badges

@enduml
